# Per-user runtime state. Never commit these: policies/ holds the documents
# people upload (their own contracts) plus the vector index built from them,
# and claims/ holds claim records and the LangGraph checkpoint DB. In a real
# deployment both are customer PII; here they are regenerable test state, and
# the binary DBs would produce unreadable diffs either way.
data/claim_pipeline/
data/user_policies/
.gitkeep
